00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:18.320
where two workers from the institute&nbsp;
pick Dory out of the ocean after they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:24.880
discover she's caught in a piece of plastic.
And further back is the Pixar lamp, aka Luxo Jr,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:28.720
who made his first Pixar appearance&nbsp;
in a short film of the same name.
&nbsp;

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:32.800
The lamp also appears on the&nbsp;
production logo of every Pixar film.
&nbsp;

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:36.800
Next to the lamp is a black piano,&nbsp;
an allusion to the piano Joe plays&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:40.160
at the Half Note club in New York.
